<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Clariant.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Clariant.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has</p>
<p>issued three million American-style call warrants on registered</p>
<p>shares of Clariant AG, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    850 CHF		   PREMIUM	13.35 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.39 CHF		  GEARING	7.84 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   21.AUG.98		 PAYDATE	20.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 20</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  845 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
